{"full":"hf:hugging-apps/fara1-5-4b-demo","spaceId":"hugging-apps/fara1-5-4b-demo","name":"Fara1.5-4B Web Computer-Use Agent","source":"huggingface","description":"Live multi-step Fara browser-agent loop on real websites","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","mcp-server","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":5,"created":"2026-07-22T21:18:47.000Z","updated":"2026-07-25T08:29:56.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://hugging-apps-fara1-5-4b-demo.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/fara1-5-4b-demo","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.714Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.714Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.714Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧭","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A live multi-step browser-agent loop for microsoft/Fara1.5-4B, a 4B vision-language computer-use agent from Microsoft Research AI Frontiers, inspired by the Fara harness.","Give it a start URL and a task; each step it screenshots the live page from a synced server-side browser (Playwright), asks Fara for the next grounded action (click/type/scroll/navigate in a normalized 0–1000 space), maps the coordinate onto a 1440×900 view via the coordinate-fix, applies it to the browser, and re-renders. It streams each action live: a per-step queue hands each update from the worker thread to the Gradio generator, so during the run the main image panel shows the current annotated frame (with a \"thinking\" status while Fara grounds the next action), the reasoning log fills in…","Runs on ZeroGPU with transformers (Qwen35ForConditionalGeneration) and playwright for the synced browser."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/fara1-5-4b-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e988d6b38e49444788c18e20fc2a729bfce9a3a9ee33796b660dae7a1e4b8feb","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:29:40.770Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08